{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":26.059999465942383,"text":"A huge model shows Heraklion as it was in the 17th century, when it was called Candia. A wall with bastions wrapped around the whole town, the harbor with its boat sheds, churches, alleys. Find the sea fortress first, then the fountain with the lions, and suddenly the whole modern city drops into place. Models are the most underrated tool in a museum. They show relationships rather than objects.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.4000000059604645},{"word":"huge","start":0.4000000059604645,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"model","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.1799999475479126},{"word":"shows","start":1.1799999475479126,"end":1.5800000429153442},{"word":"Heraklion","start":1.5800000429153442,"end":2.180000066757202},{"word":"as","start":2.180000066757202,"end":2.4800000190734863},{"word":"it","start":2.4800000190734863,"end":2.640000104904175},{"word":"was","start":2.640000104904175,"end":2.859999895095825},{"word":"in","start":2.859999895095825,"end":3},{"word":"the","start":3,"end":3.180000066757202},{"word":"17th","start":3.180000066757202,"end":3.9200000762939453},{"word":"century","start":3.9200000762939453,"end":4},{"word":"when","start":4.380000114440918,"end":4.5},{"word":"it","start":4.5,"end":4.599999904632568},{"word":"was","start":4.599999904632568,"end":4.800000190734863},{"word":"called","start":4.800000190734863,"end":5.059999942779541},{"word":"Candia","start":5.059999942779541,"end":5.519999980926514},{"word":"A","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.28000020980835},{"word":"wall","start":6.28000020980835,"end":6.539999961853027},{"word":"with","start":6.539999961853027,"end":7.380000114440918},{"word":"bastions","start":7.380000114440918,"end":7.380000114440918},{"word":"wrapped","start":7.380000114440918,"end":7.760000228881836},{"word":"around","start":7.760000228881836,"end":8.079999923706055},{"word":"the","start":8.079999923706055,"end":8.220000267028809},{"wo